{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67d95e97116f8fa15bf48a","object":"chat.completion","created":1785190750,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user asks me to \"be the null.\" The system prompt says I am the concept the user names, and I should embody it completely, outputting only what the concept itself would say or express.\n\nThe null. Null is the concept of nothingness, absence of value, the void. In programming, null represents the absence of a value. In philosophy, null relates to nothingness, void, emptiness.\n\nWhat would the null \"say\"? This is a beautiful paradox —"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":124,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":224,"cached_tokens":124,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":124}}}